      "writtenOn": "2022-09-23T17:29:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What about making this a \"choice\" config?  This would provide flexibility for additional default SVDM types.  It also makes it explicit that the custom choice is enabled, and this provides a place to document the requirements for the user when using the custom option.\n\nI also think moving this into a separate file, Kconfig.svdm_rsp would be good, since the PLATFORM_EC namespace doesn\u0027t need to be used for these zephyr only symbols.\n\n\n```\nchoice SVDM_RSP_CHOICE\n    default SVDM_RSP_DFP_ONLY if !PLATFORM_EC_USB_PD_USB4 \n \u0026\u0026 !PLATFORM_EC_USB_PD_TBT_COMPAT_MODE \u0026\u0026 !PLATFORM_EC_USB_PD_USB32_DRD\n    default SVDM_RSP_CUSTOM\n    ...\n\nconfig SVDM_RSP_DFP_ONLY\n    ...\n    \nconfig SVDM_RSP_CUSTOM\n    ...\n    \nendchoice\n```",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 219,
        "startChar": 7,
        "endLine": 219,
        "endChar": 40
      },
      "revId": "61ed2bf3ca44f567b67eaf67ab8ccbf04c2b9ffc",
