      "message": "There\u0027s not a clear best location for this code at the moment.  Ultimately, once the USB-C stack is upstream, this will live under zephyr/subsys/usb_c.\n\nI think for now I favor adding this to the common/usbc directory to keep all USB-C files together.  The svdm file should note that it is only supported for Zephyr boards.",
